\ Living Dispatch. All topology, route choices, jobs, movement and events are native.
\ 16 intersections, 48 directed edges, 3 vehicles. One tick advances at most
\ one road-progress unit. Arrivals and new departures occur in different ticks.
here constant city-roads 240 allot
here constant city-costs 48 allot
here constant city-trial 48 allot
here constant city-cars 96 allot
here constant city-dist 16 allot
here constant city-prev 16 allot
here constant city-seen 16 allot
here constant city-path 16 allot
here constant city-head 16 allot
here constant city-next 48 allot
variable city-edges
variable city-tick
variable city-generation
variable city-cache-version
variable city-cache-generation
variable city-sequence
variable city-rule
variable ci
variable cj
variable cv
variable ce
variable ca
variable cb
variable ct
variable cd
variable cs
variable cbest
variable cchosen
variable clen
variable cvalid
variable cserial
variable city-last-duration
variable city-last-toll
variable city-last-cost
variable city-last-valid

